# Local build output. The cross-compiled Linux binaries used to be TRACKED
# (terminal-linux-amd64 was 14 MB, quiet-radio-linux-amd64 4 MB) — 18 MB of
# build output that every clone pays for forever. Untracked as of the
# release tidy-up; see LICENSING.md's note about history if the size of the
# pack matters before the first push.
/terminal
/quiet-bridge
/terminal-linux-amd64
/quiet-radio-linux-amd64
*-linux-amd64
*-linux-arm64
*-darwin-amd64
*-darwin-arm64

# The release signing key and where it lives (AR-1e). Never in the repo.
android/host/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
